sequenceDiagram
    participant Model
    participant Application
    participant Tool
    
    Application->>Model: Current State
    Note over Model: Internal Reasoning (CoT)
    Model->>Application: Tool Proposal
    
    Note over Application: Validate & Authorize
    Application->>Tool: Execute Read
    Tool-->>Application: Observation (Evidence)
    
    Note over Application: Mutate State & Trace
    Application->>Model: Updated State
